":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":1689390834,"text":"でも…はぁ…興奮しすぎて、ロウと一緒に変な場所に隠れたりしてないだろうな…","nextNodeIds":[240040118]},{"nodeId":240040118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":2170039034,"text":"#{M#お兄さん}{F#お姉さん}、申し訳ないんですけど、また一緒に俺たちと遊んでくれませんか？","nextNodeIds":[240040119]},{"nodeId":240040119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":111198922,"text":"ヴェルーのやつがスネるといけないから、俺も隠れる場所を探さないと。こんな街のど真ん中で泣かれたら、どうしようもないし…","nextNodeIds":[240040120]},{"nodeId":240040120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":2972105986,"text":"オーレルは立ち去った…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":240040114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2782178074,"text":"ロウについて…","nextNodeIds":[240040115]},{"nodeId":240040115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":1702117658,"text":"さっき知り合った女の子です。俺たちがかくれんぼしてるのを見て、一緒に遊びたいって。","nextNodeIds":[240040116]},{"nodeId":240040116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":2163931010,"text":"彼女はヴェルーと性格が似てるし、仲良くしてくれてるみたいです。","nextNodeIds":[240040117]},{"nodeId":240040117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5063,"speakerName":"オーレル","textMapHash":1278681218,"text":"それに…あの子もお父さんが忙しくてあまり遊んでくれないって言ってました。その点は俺たちと似てるかも。","nextNodeIds":[240040118]},{"nodeId":240040104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1216317922,"text":"またかくれんぼしてるの？","nextNodeIds":[240040105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2400401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUI